SwapModule_Execute
├── when targetToken is zero address
│   ├── it should return success false with "Zero target token"
│   └── it should return zero address as outputToken
├── when dexRouter is zero address
│   ├── it should return success false with "Zero DEX router"
│   └── it should return targetToken as outputToken
├── when caller has insufficient balance
│   └── it should return success false with "Insufficient balance"
├── when multiple validations fail
│   └── it should return the first failing validation
├── when input token equals target token
│   └── it should still return "Swap not implemented" (no same-token guard in execute)
└── when all validations pass
    ├── it should return success false with "Swap not implemented"
    ├── it should return zero amountOut
    ├── it should return targetToken as outputToken
    └── it should not transfer any tokens
